## Benefits Summary

| Issue | Before | After |
|-------|--------|-------|
| Competing workflows | Each detects independently | Single classification, explicit priority |
| Collision surfaces | N × (N-1) pairs collide | Single router makes all decisions |
| New workflow risk | Multiplies collision risk | Add to priority table, inherit safety |
| Debugging conflicts | Trace through N interceptors | Check `IntentResult.reason` |
| State management | 100+ global variables | Single state dict passed to handlers |
| Fallthrough behavior | LLM sees multiple workflows' context injections | LLM sees context only from chosen workflow |
| Testing workflows | Hard to isolate—all others run too | Test handler with mocked state |
| Scaling | Linear degradation as features add | O(1) collision risk regardless of count |

